g's demise and have uploaded the patch, so the immediate danger has passed. I'll get back to my task at hand.\n\n\n**Analyzing Current Changes**\n\nI have just finished reviewing the fix for the annoying warnings and have pushed the update. My process included killing the offending background process and patching the file paths, and changing the script to read directly from `revision.txt`. I'm going to take a break from this task and enjoy a much-deserved vacation.\n\n\n"}
