ed that loop, just like you suspected. I've broken down the table of why and how, to make it all work, so it's all much clearer now, ¿no?\n\n\n**Refining Error Correction**\n\nI'm continuing to refine the error correction. I've pinpointed the erratic movement – it was that loop, as you predicted, but now I understand the full story. The spam of arrows was the culprit, and it was causing unwanted character movement in the overworld. My fix will be just to use X to close menus. I've got this, mi amor.\n\n\n"}
